@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@authToken = paste-login-token-here

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### DB health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/db/health

### Create host user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

